{"sections":{"rich_text_rdHadM":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_fGKMyw":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"{{ page.title }}","size":"h1"}},"text_LAqiiA":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ page.content }}","style":"text"}},"buttons_P7WYaA":{"type":"buttons","settings":{"first_button_label":"","first_button_link":"","first_button_style":false,"second_button_label":"","second_button_link":"","second_button_style":true}}},"block_order":["heading_fGKMyw","text_LAqiiA","buttons_P7WYaA"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"full_width":false,"text_position":"center center","overlay":30,"image_height_large":"medium","image_height_mobile":"medium","enable_parallax":false,"padding_top":1,"padding_bottom":0.5,"soft_background":true,"color_scheme":"default-with-accent-1","custom_colors":false,"color_foreground":"#061c2f","color_accent":"#0d91bd","color_background":"#ffffff","color_gradient":""}},"hero_9Rkh4q":{"type":"hero","blocks":{"slide_aL443L":{"type":"slide","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/gotham-studios_BW.jpg","subheading":"Gotham Studios","title":"Our Story","text":"<p>It started with three creatives and a bold idea: build a photography studio that brought people, brands, and design together under one roof. In a converted warehouse on Wangaratta Street, Richmond, <strong>Gotham Studios Melbourne<\/strong> was born.<\/p><p>Five studios. Eleven photographers. Graphic and web teams. A working darkroom. Big-name fashion events. The kind of space where Claudia Schiffer could glide between magazine shoots without missing a beat.<\/p><p>It was electric. Collaborative. Way ahead of its time.<br\/>We became known not just for our images, but for being the place to be.<br\/>But time, as we know, changes everything.<\/p><p>As the industry shifted, digital platforms rose, brands moved faster, budgets tightened, and DIY imagery flooded the market.” Clients began asking:<br\/>“Can we simplify the process?”<br\/>“Can you help us stay on budget, on time?”<br\/>We listened.<\/p><p>So we did something no one else had: <strong>we launched Melbourne’s first prepaid headshot packages<\/strong>. It was a game-changing model—simple, fixed pricing that removed the guesswork from hiring a professional photographer and put our clients back in control. Suddenly, creatives and corporations alike could plan confidently.<\/p><p>Then something unexpected happened: <strong>overseas clients started coming to us.<\/strong><\/p><p>Today, brands from around the world choose us as their trusted creative partner. From casting and creative direction to full production and retouching, we handle it all—right here in Melbourne. They never have to step on set. And yet, they get world-class visuals that look like they did.<\/p><p>Because while we’ve evolved, our core remains the same: <strong>We believe that good quality photography should be available to everyone.<\/strong><\/p><p>No one should miss out on the chance to work with a professional, whether you're a startup founder needing a great headshot or a brand launching your next big product overseas.<\/p><p>That belief still drives everything we do.<br\/> It’s why our prepaid model exists.<br\/> It’s why we keep our pricing transparent.<br\/>And it’s why we’re still the trusted partner for professionals and B2B brands 26 years on.<\/p><p>So if you’re ready for photography that respects your time, your budget, and your brand, let’s make it easy. <\/p><p><strong>Gotham Studios Melbourne. We are your photographers.<\/strong><\/p>","text_size":"medium","text_position_large":"center start","text_position_mobile":"start","first_button_label":"BOOK YOUR FREE CONSULT →","first_button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/contact","first_button_arrow_style":false,"second_button_label":"VIEW PORTFOLIO","second_button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/portfolio","second_button_arrow_style":false,"color_scheme":"default-with-accent-1","custom_colors":false,"color_foreground":"#061c2f","color_accent":"#0d91bd","color_background